# HP50g ARMToolbox installation through the original HP UI.
# Put the destination port number on the stack, recall SETUP.BIN from SD,
# temporarily HALT the File Manager to return to the stack, evaluate the
# recalled installer, then warmstart and inspect port 2 for library 275.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
6500 tap two
6800 tap period
7100 tap enter
7900 capture port-number
8500 chord lshift files
10700 capture files
11000 tap up
11300 tap f6
13000 capture sd
13300 tap enter
13600 tap down
14300 capture sd-setup
14700 tap f4
16000 capture recalled-in-filer
16400 tap nxt
16800 tap nxt
17600 capture filer-halt-menu
18000 tap f1
19300 capture recalled-stack
19800 tap eval
21500 capture setup-evaluated
22500 chord on f3
24500 capture warmstart
25000 chord rshift two
26200 capture lib
26600 tap f3
27900 capture port2
28300 finish-install
